title: Shelf3A
---
<<declare $r1_dinner_shelf = false>>
// Talk target of Samantha's bookshelf (Interact layer).
<<if not $r1_dinner_shelf>>
    <<set $r1_dinner_shelf to true>>
    {$samantha_name}: Find anything interesting?
    You: "Power and Intimacy: A Reader." Is this for your course?
    {$samantha_name}: Some of it is.
    You: And the rest?
    {$samantha_name}: The rest is for fun. Put it back where you found it.
<<else>>
    {$samantha_name}: It's not going anywhere. Neither is dinner. Sit.
<<endif>>
===
